// Copy this to Config/Signing.xcconfig (which git ignores) and add your Apple
// developer Team ID to build for a phone. Leave it empty for the Simulator.
//
// It lives here rather than in project.yml because it differs per machine, and
// here it survives `xcodegen generate`; a Team set in Xcode's UI doesn't.
// Find yours in Xcode > Settings > Accounts.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
